{
  "name": "Gmail 客服郵件智慧分類與自動歸檔系統",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📧 範例 6：Gmail 客服郵件智慧分類與自動歸檔系統\n\n1. **Webhook / 郵件接收**：模擬接收進線客戶 Email（寄件者、主旨、內文）。\n2. **AI Agent 語義分類**：自動分析郵件類別（投訴/詢價/技術/合作）、急迫度與 30 字重點摘要。\n3. **Switch 條件分流**：若為「緊急投訴」，立即推播 Telegram / LINE 警報。\n4. **Google Sheets 歸檔**：將分析結果自動追加至工單總表。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        100
      ],
      "id": "email-classifier-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "email-incoming",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        380
      ],
      "id": "webhook-incoming-email",
      "name": "接收客服郵件 Webhook",
      "webhookId": "email-incoming-endpoint"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=請分析以下客戶郵件：\n寄件者：{{ $json.body.sender || 'client@example.com' }}\n主旨：{{ $json.body.subject || '產品無法登入，系統一直報錯' }}\n內文：{{ $json.body.body || '從今天早上開始我們整個團隊都無法登入後台，出現 Error 500，請盡快協助處理，這嚴重影響我們的業務運作！' }}\n\n請務必輸出標準 JSON 格式（不要包含 markdown 標籤），格式如下：\n{\n  \"category\": \"系統故障 / 業務詢價 / 一般諮詢 / 退款客訴 / 垃圾郵件\",\n  \"urgency\": \"高 / 中 / 低\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"負面 / 中立 / 正面\",\n  \"summary\": \"30字以內的精簡核心摘要\",\n  \"suggested_action\": \"建議後續處理行動方針\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是一位企業客服工單智能分流專家。請客觀嚴謹地評估郵件的類別、急迫度與情感傾向，並輸出合法標準 JSON 物件。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        80,
        380
      ],
      "id": "ai-email-classifier-agent",
      "name": "AI 郵件意圖與急迫度分類代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        80,
        600
      ],
      "id": "email-openai-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 解析 AI 輸出的 JSON 字串\nconst rawOutput = $input.first().json.output || '';\nlet parsed = {};\ntry {\n  const clean = rawOutput.replace(/```json/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n  parsed = JSON.parse(clean);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = {\n    category: '一般諮詢',\n    urgency: '中',\n    sentiment: '中立',\n    summary: 'AI 解析異常',\n    suggested_action: '轉人工客服確認'\n  };\n}\n\nconst rawBody = $('接收客服郵件 Webhook').item.json.body || {};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    sender: rawBody.sender || 'client@example.com',\n    subject: rawBody.subject || '無主旨',\n    category: parsed.category,\n    urgency: parsed.urgency,\n    sentiment: parsed.sentiment,\n    summary: parsed.summary,\n    suggested_action: parsed.suggested_action,\n    is_urgent: parsed.urgency === '高',\n    received_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        360,
        380
      ],
      "id": "parse-classifier-json",
      "name": "解析與組裝結構化資料"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-high-urgency",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.is_urgent }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        620,
        380
      ],
      "id": "check-high-urgency",
      "name": "是否為高急迫度？"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "客服郵件分類總表",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        480
      ],
      "id": "append-sheets-record",
      "name": "Google Sheets 記錄工單",
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
